# apps/api Rules

## Runtime: Cloudflare Workers — not Node.js

**Never use `process.env`** — env vars live on Hono context:

```ts
// ✅
app.get("/route", (c) => {
  const token = c.env.GITHUB_TOKEN
  const db = c.env.portfolio_cache
})

// ❌ Will throw
const token = process.env.GITHUB_TOKEN
```

## Secrets (Cloudflare Dashboard only — never commit)
- `GITHUB_TOKEN` — GitHub GraphQL auth

## Bindings (`wrangler.toml`)
- `portfolio_cache` — D1 database (SQLite)

## Hono pattern
```ts
import { Hono } from "hono"
import type { Bindings } from "./types/bindings.js"

const route = new Hono<{ Bindings: Bindings }>()
route.get("/path", async (c) => c.json(data))
```

Always use `.js` extensions in local imports (ESM + Workers requirement).

## Routes
- `GET /api/health`
- `GET /api/github/contributions` — D1 cache → GitHub GraphQL fallback

## Cron
Daily at 03:00 UTC. Handler: `src/cron.ts`. Triggered by Cloudflare, not HTTP.
